WEBVTT

00:33.580 --> 00:37.020
=Royal Upstart 2=
(Based on "Zhenguan Foolish Son-in-Law")

00:37.325 --> 00:39.837
=Episode 20=

00:39.885 --> 00:42.600
(Blasting Corrupt Officials,
Shaking the World!)

00:52.039 --> 00:53.640
Cowardly rats.

01:08.437 --> 01:09.638
This...

01:16.280 --> 01:17.000
This...

01:17.010 --> 01:17.679
Nothing's happening.

01:17.679 --> 01:18.679
You're right.

01:19.119 --> 01:20.240
Just as I thought.

01:20.460 --> 01:22.960
The brat Wei Hao was just bluffing

01:22.960 --> 01:24.000
to trick us.

01:24.320 --> 01:25.600
This behavior

01:25.600 --> 01:27.159
should be strictly punished...

01:34.725 --> 01:35.966
- Your Majesty.
- Your Majesty.

01:41.240 --> 01:42.119
- This...
- This...

01:45.119 --> 01:45.679
This...

01:48.599 --> 01:50.239
This is simply

01:50.400 --> 01:51.760
the power of thunder.

01:51.760 --> 01:53.560
It's more powerful than a battering ram.

01:53.959 --> 01:55.200
It's too dangerous.

01:55.719 --> 01:56.519
Fuji.

02:02.599 --> 02:03.879
Wei Hao, you brat,

02:04.040 --> 02:05.719
you set me up.

02:06.359 --> 02:07.599
I told you to step back.

02:07.599 --> 02:09.000
Everyone heard it.

02:09.840 --> 02:10.640
Right.

02:10.640 --> 02:12.480
Marquis Wei did try
to warn him just now.

02:12.480 --> 02:13.239
Your Majesty,

02:13.400 --> 02:15.000
Minister Zhangsun seems to be injured.

02:15.000 --> 02:17.719
Quickly, call the imperial physician.
Take Fuji down to rest.

02:17.719 --> 02:18.500
Yes, Your Majesty.

02:23.100 --> 02:24.590
That's what you get for not listening.

02:25.879 --> 02:26.680
Good.

02:27.079 --> 02:28.519
This is a wonderful thing.

02:30.040 --> 02:31.599
I like this very much.

02:31.599 --> 02:33.159
So, shattered, aren't you?

02:33.959 --> 02:34.959
A little thing like this

02:35.400 --> 02:36.680
has such immense power.

02:37.439 --> 02:38.760
How did you make it?

02:39.439 --> 02:40.239
Besides,

02:40.239 --> 02:42.760
what exactly is inside this bamboo tube?

02:42.879 --> 02:43.879
Gunpowder.

02:44.159 --> 02:45.000
Sir,

02:45.000 --> 02:45.799
how about

02:46.480 --> 02:47.760
I strap it to you to find out?

02:47.799 --> 02:48.599
You fool.

02:48.770 --> 02:49.599
Stop messing around.

02:50.920 --> 02:51.719
Also,

02:52.360 --> 02:53.240
this gunpowder

02:53.680 --> 02:55.360
is vital to the Great Yong.

02:55.960 --> 02:57.840
You must not let the secret leak out.

02:58.280 --> 02:59.159
Of course.

03:01.199 --> 03:02.000
Let

03:02.639 --> 03:03.319
me see.

03:03.319 --> 03:04.080
Your Majesty,

03:04.240 --> 03:05.439
your body is precious.

03:05.439 --> 03:06.800
It's not suitable for
you to play with this.

03:06.800 --> 03:07.680
I'll check it for you.

03:07.680 --> 03:08.439
I'll go.

03:09.599 --> 03:10.479
Go further away.

03:10.840 --> 03:11.919
Run further back.

03:14.639 --> 03:16.280
Don't light it while holding it.

03:24.010 --> 03:25.639
It sounds like
an entire army roaring in.

03:25.960 --> 03:26.960
Such divine power.

03:26.960 --> 03:28.240
The power is enormous.

03:28.240 --> 03:28.879
Such divine power.

03:28.879 --> 03:31.319
With this, the enemy's
iron cavalry will be no threat.

03:32.479 --> 03:33.479
This is incredible.

03:34.759 --> 03:35.680
Beautiful.

03:36.159 --> 03:37.080
Magnificent.

03:37.960 --> 03:40.879
I can almost see
the iron cavalry of the Great Yong

03:41.039 --> 03:42.520
galloping across the battlefield,

03:43.159 --> 03:45.360
easily blasting fortresses to the ground

03:46.319 --> 03:48.960
with the momentum of sweeping the world.

03:54.000 --> 03:55.560
Are you crazy?

03:56.000 --> 03:57.280
I almost lost my life.

04:01.879 --> 04:02.759
Wei the Fool,

04:03.039 --> 04:05.159
this gunpowder's power is so fierce.

04:05.159 --> 04:06.199
Who taught you this?

04:06.199 --> 04:07.479
I researched it myself.

04:07.639 --> 04:08.680
I told you long ago,

04:08.680 --> 04:10.490
I'm the world's No. 1
in investigating things.

04:11.100 --> 04:12.879
I told those people
at the Ministry of Works,

04:12.879 --> 04:14.100
but they wouldn't believe me.

04:14.199 --> 04:15.199
I'm not bragging,

04:15.520 --> 04:17.000
but all of them combined

04:17.000 --> 04:18.400
aren't worth one of my fingers.

04:18.400 --> 04:19.000
Just look at them...

04:19.000 --> 04:19.520
Enough.

04:20.039 --> 04:22.120
Your boasting is getting out of hand.

04:22.120 --> 04:23.280
I'm boasting?

04:23.860 --> 04:25.520
Ask your people
from the Ministry of Works

04:25.530 --> 04:27.050
if they even know how to use gunpowder.

04:28.000 --> 04:29.560
When it comes to dealing with the enemy,

04:29.560 --> 04:30.919
how many ways are there to use it?

04:30.919 --> 04:32.479
Didn't you demonstrate it today?

04:32.840 --> 04:34.159
It only has those few uses.

04:34.159 --> 04:35.159
Nothing more

04:35.240 --> 04:36.240
than blasting city walls

04:36.319 --> 04:37.400
and scaring the enemy.

04:37.960 --> 04:39.159
If used on the battlefield,

04:39.159 --> 04:40.159
that's all it does.

04:40.599 --> 04:42.240
As for defeating the enemy,

04:42.560 --> 04:44.960
we still rely on infantry,
cavalry, and archers.

04:44.960 --> 04:45.719
Ignorant.

04:47.039 --> 04:48.400
Say that again, I dare you.

04:48.479 --> 04:50.039
You're still calling me uneducated?

04:50.240 --> 04:51.240
What did I say?

04:51.759 --> 04:52.199
You...

04:53.840 --> 04:54.680
Father-in-law, look.

05:00.090 --> 05:02.600
These are two sketches I drew for
the Ministry of Works earlier today

05:02.600 --> 05:04.639
while I was making gunpowder.

05:04.680 --> 05:06.680
If the Great Yong could produce these,

05:06.680 --> 05:08.920
even if all the world's enemies
banded together,

05:08.959 --> 05:10.680
they would be no match for us.

05:11.380 --> 05:13.519
Just have the Ministry of Works
follow these designs.

05:29.560 --> 05:30.920
Can...

05:32.279 --> 05:32.600
Can...

05:34.639 --> 05:36.279
Can this really be achieved?

05:36.439 --> 05:37.319
I

05:37.480 --> 05:38.279
am Wei Hao.

05:38.639 --> 05:41.120
There's nothing I can't do,
only things I haven't thought of.

05:42.120 --> 05:43.079
Wei Hao,

05:44.079 --> 05:44.959
this gunpowder

05:45.079 --> 05:47.160
is your massive achievement.

05:47.800 --> 05:48.920
What reward do you want?

05:48.920 --> 05:49.759
Just name it.

05:49.759 --> 05:50.480
Father-in-law,

05:50.480 --> 05:51.399
forget about rewards.

05:51.399 --> 05:53.439
As long as you marry Princess Ning'an
to me as soon as possible,

05:53.439 --> 05:54.920
other rewards aren't worth mentioning.

05:55.319 --> 05:56.000
Well...

05:56.000 --> 05:57.600
You don't want anything else?

05:57.610 --> 05:59.519
Nothing is more important
than marrying Ning'an.

06:00.160 --> 06:00.959
Of course.

06:01.160 --> 06:03.279
But if there could be some
official title bestowed...

06:03.279 --> 06:04.000
Fine.

06:05.360 --> 06:07.360
Then, my precious daughter

06:07.439 --> 06:09.240
will be given away to a fool like you.

06:11.400 --> 06:12.440
(He agreed just like that?)

06:12.720 --> 06:14.120
(He's finally giving in?)

06:15.519 --> 06:17.480
The Empress and I have discussed it.

06:17.480 --> 06:19.199
We agree to grant this marriage.

06:19.839 --> 06:21.360
The decree will be issued soon.

06:21.800 --> 06:22.600
As for the date,

06:22.639 --> 06:24.800
it will be early in the 7th year
of the Great Yong.

06:25.000 --> 06:26.560
I will instruct the Ministry of Rites

06:26.560 --> 06:28.160
to make all the preparations.

06:29.680 --> 06:30.600
Well,

06:31.439 --> 06:32.800
what about Ning'an...

06:34.319 --> 06:36.399
If it weren't for her silent consent,

06:36.759 --> 06:38.600
why would I have given her away

06:38.680 --> 06:40.680
to you so easily, you fool?

06:45.160 --> 06:46.319
Thank you, Father-in-law.

06:46.480 --> 06:47.720
Thank you, Mother-in-law.

06:48.279 --> 06:49.079
Brat,

06:49.439 --> 06:50.720
don't get too smug.

06:50.879 --> 06:53.439
Do you know
that once this decree is sent out,

06:53.920 --> 06:56.079
you will face immense pressure?

06:56.920 --> 06:57.720
Pressure?

06:57.730 --> 06:59.399
What pressure is there
in getting married?

06:59.399 --> 07:00.600
Who would dare to pressure me?

07:01.120 --> 07:03.079
Don't you know

07:03.199 --> 07:05.399
that the great clans
do not allow their sons

07:05.399 --> 07:07.079
to marry into the Imperial Family?

07:08.680 --> 07:09.800
There's actually such a rule?

07:12.319 --> 07:13.240
Wei Hao,

07:14.000 --> 07:16.279
this matter is not that simple.

07:16.639 --> 07:17.959
You might face

07:18.079 --> 07:20.439
strong resistance from every great clan.

07:20.959 --> 07:21.759
By then,

07:22.079 --> 07:25.199
it will be even more serious
than the glaze workshop incident.

07:25.439 --> 07:26.480
The Wei clan

07:26.560 --> 07:28.279
won't step in to protect you either.

07:28.319 --> 07:29.120
In fact,

07:29.279 --> 07:31.360
they will be forced by other great clans

07:31.439 --> 07:33.240
to expel you from the Wei clan.

07:34.240 --> 07:36.240
That's strange.

07:36.879 --> 07:39.399
What does my marriage
have to do with them?

07:39.560 --> 07:41.399
They even want to expel me?

07:41.560 --> 07:42.800
I am not afraid.

07:43.199 --> 07:45.560
If they push me,
I'll just wipe out the great clans.

07:45.800 --> 07:47.439
I am glad to see

07:47.639 --> 07:48.839
you have this resolve.

07:49.279 --> 07:51.399
The great clans will surely take action.

07:51.399 --> 07:53.720
When that time comes,
the Imperial Family will step up

07:53.959 --> 07:55.199
to stand with you.

07:56.520 --> 07:57.800
You're a real one, Father-in-law.

07:58.600 --> 07:59.519
In that case,

08:00.560 --> 08:02.079
I'll go home and wait for the decree.

08:03.040 --> 08:03.639
Good.

08:05.639 --> 08:06.439
Yes!

08:14.759 --> 08:16.279
(Wei Mansion)
By the grace of Heaven,

08:16.279 --> 08:17.879
the Emperor decrees:

08:18.439 --> 08:20.360
Wei Hao of the Wei clan

08:20.560 --> 08:22.160
possesses exceptional talent

08:22.240 --> 08:23.720
and remarkable ingenuity,

08:23.839 --> 08:25.720
earning my high praise.

08:26.160 --> 08:27.680
The Eldest Princess Baoqing

08:27.759 --> 08:29.079
is wise and discerning,

08:29.160 --> 08:30.399
devoted to the state

08:30.519 --> 08:31.879
and the people's welfare.

08:31.959 --> 08:33.519
Her virtue and foresight

08:33.519 --> 08:35.120
are praised by the court and commoners.

08:35.279 --> 08:37.199
The two share virtuous deeds

08:37.240 --> 08:38.600
and matching hearts.

08:38.680 --> 08:40.800
(Cui Clan Spy)
Truly a match made in heaven.

08:41.000 --> 08:42.959
(Wang Clan Spy)
I hereby issue this edict.

08:43.000 --> 08:47.319
(Wang and Zheng Clan Spies)
Wei Hao and Princess Baoqing are betrothed.

08:47.480 --> 08:49.439
Choose an auspicious day
for the wedding.

08:49.600 --> 08:51.199
(Lu Clan Spy)
By the decree.

08:51.639 --> 08:52.839
Thank you, Your Majesty.

08:53.000 --> 08:54.720
(Cui Mansion)
The Weis dare marry into the Imperial Family?

08:54.959 --> 08:56.920
This defies the limits
of the great clans.

08:58.040 --> 08:59.120
The Wei clan is nothing.

08:59.399 --> 09:01.199
Cui must already have a plan.

09:01.279 --> 09:01.800
Let's go.

09:02.160 --> 09:02.680
Let's go.

09:04.279 --> 09:05.240
This is wonderful.

09:06.720 --> 09:08.600
Your marriage to
the Princess is finally set.

09:09.040 --> 09:10.399
You have such a hot temper.

09:10.399 --> 09:11.560
If someone were to plot against you,

09:11.560 --> 09:13.090
even your status as
Marquis couldn't save you.

09:13.100 --> 09:14.240
But things are different now.

09:14.639 --> 09:16.799
You're marrying the Eldest Princess.

09:16.799 --> 09:18.360
Let's see who dares to bully you now.

09:25.600 --> 09:27.000
Aunt, why are you crying?

09:28.600 --> 09:29.519
I am not.

09:30.240 --> 09:31.679
Now that your marriage is settled,

09:31.679 --> 09:33.759
I must quickly write to your parents

09:33.759 --> 09:34.879
and have them come back.

09:34.879 --> 09:36.790
Thank you for
taking care of me all these years.

09:36.919 --> 09:37.720
Once I'm married,

09:37.720 --> 09:39.220
you can finally enjoy a life of ease.

09:41.279 --> 09:42.240
Hao,

09:42.600 --> 09:44.120
are you trying to kick me out?

09:45.960 --> 09:47.080
That's not what I meant.

09:47.399 --> 09:48.480
I've never even imagined

09:48.480 --> 09:49.799
that you would ever leave me.

09:50.000 --> 09:52.190
Young Master, you really
don't know how to care for people.

09:52.200 --> 09:53.559
Back then, for your sake,

09:53.559 --> 09:55.279
Young Madam rejected
countless marriage proposals.

09:55.279 --> 09:56.639
She remains unmarried to this day.

09:56.900 --> 09:58.279
Have you ever even asked about it?

10:01.639 --> 10:02.600
Look at me.

10:03.039 --> 10:04.799
If you take a liking to
any gentleman later,

10:05.200 --> 10:06.279
I'll settle it for you.

10:08.039 --> 10:09.840
You really do want to drive me away.

10:10.799 --> 10:11.480
No.

10:11.480 --> 10:13.879
From the very beginning,
I had no intention of making you leave.

10:14.000 --> 10:15.639
I was thinking
that once the new house is ready,

10:15.639 --> 10:17.159
I'd bring you over to live with us.

10:18.350 --> 10:19.799
What nonsense are you talking about?

10:19.800 --> 10:21.200
It's the residence for
you and the Princess.

10:21.200 --> 10:22.840
What would it look like if I moved in?

10:23.000 --> 10:24.039
What's wrong with that?

10:24.720 --> 10:26.000
If you never marry,

10:26.320 --> 10:27.279
I'll take care of you.

10:29.360 --> 10:30.639
You brat.

10:30.650 --> 10:31.720
Who are you saying can't get married?

10:31.730 --> 10:33.039
Are you saying I can't find a husband?

10:33.039 --> 10:34.559
What kind of logic is that?

10:34.559 --> 10:36.120
Say that again.

10:37.679 --> 10:38.480
Young Madam.

10:38.720 --> 10:39.519
Young Madam,

10:39.759 --> 10:41.200
the Clan Leader sent word.

10:41.360 --> 10:42.480
He asks you to go over.

10:45.639 --> 10:46.440
Just as expected.

10:46.500 --> 10:48.279
The hurdle of the great clans
must be faced.

10:51.025 --> 10:54.525
(Baozheng Hall)

11:02.120 --> 11:03.159
Greetings, Clan Leader.

11:03.399 --> 11:04.639
Greetings, elders.

11:08.679 --> 11:10.039
Young Madam Lin,

11:10.200 --> 11:11.879
what are you doing?

11:11.960 --> 11:14.720
Why was there no word of this at all?

11:16.039 --> 11:17.480
Word of what?

11:17.919 --> 11:20.720
The matter of Wei Hao
and the Eldest Princess.

11:21.519 --> 11:23.720
His Majesty has
already decreed the marriage.

11:25.600 --> 11:26.639
Oh, that.

11:27.159 --> 11:28.039
I came today

11:28.039 --> 11:29.759
to tell you about this.

11:30.039 --> 11:32.759
On the 22nd of this month,
Hao will hold an engagement banquet

11:32.759 --> 11:34.279
with the Princess at Juxian Restaurant.

11:34.480 --> 11:36.600
Please make sure to attend.

11:40.360 --> 11:40.919
Do...

11:42.960 --> 11:44.559
Do you really not know

11:45.000 --> 11:47.600
about the agreement
between our great clans?

11:47.720 --> 11:49.879
We cannot marry
the Emperor's princesses,

11:49.879 --> 11:51.799
nor can we wed into the Imperial Family.

11:53.919 --> 11:55.000
Well,

11:55.480 --> 11:56.960
no one ever told me about it.

11:57.279 --> 11:57.639
Well...

11:58.960 --> 11:59.919
It's no wonder.

12:00.440 --> 12:01.960
I'm just a weak woman.

12:02.320 --> 12:03.399
All these years,

12:03.519 --> 12:06.200
you elders never looked me in the eye.

12:06.519 --> 12:09.000
You even kicked Hao
and me out, Clan Leader.

12:09.440 --> 12:11.559
It's only natural that I wouldn't know.

12:12.039 --> 12:13.039
It's a small matter.

12:13.679 --> 12:16.000
But Hao marrying the Princess

12:16.360 --> 12:17.519
is a wonderful thing.

12:17.759 --> 12:18.440
Isn't it?

12:19.879 --> 12:20.919
Wonderful?

12:21.770 --> 12:23.240
You've broken the decades-old alliance

12:23.240 --> 12:24.200
between our great clans,

12:24.200 --> 12:25.590
and you call it a "wonderful thing"?

12:26.320 --> 12:27.200
Can you bear

12:27.879 --> 12:29.080
this responsibility?

12:29.240 --> 12:29.840
Exactly.

12:33.240 --> 12:34.600
That's a bit too much.

12:35.360 --> 12:36.639
Since when did the relationship

12:36.960 --> 12:39.039
between great clans
rely on such agreements?

12:39.440 --> 12:40.279
Besides,

12:40.559 --> 12:42.320
what does Hao's
marriage have to do with you?

12:42.679 --> 12:44.679
What right do you have
to come here and gossip?

12:45.440 --> 12:46.799
This is the Wei clan's business.

12:46.919 --> 12:48.840
Since when is it
your place to criticize us?

12:48.840 --> 12:49.480
You!

12:53.220 --> 12:56.159
Clan Leader Wei, is this how the younger
generation of your clan behaves?

12:57.360 --> 12:58.279
My surname is Lin.

12:58.519 --> 12:59.679
Strictly speaking,

12:59.960 --> 13:02.200
I am not considered
a member of the Wei clan.

13:05.559 --> 13:07.039
Young Madam Lin,

13:07.159 --> 13:08.639
this is a matter of great importance.

13:08.679 --> 13:09.960
Wei Furong is away,

13:09.960 --> 13:11.000
and he left you in charge.

13:11.000 --> 13:12.879
Don't take this so lightly.

13:12.879 --> 13:14.120
It's just a small marriage,

13:14.759 --> 13:16.320
yet you make it sound so serious.

13:17.039 --> 13:18.600
As for who Hao will marry,

13:18.679 --> 13:20.159
that is our private family matter.

13:20.500 --> 13:22.100
Do you intend to interfere in that too?

13:22.279 --> 13:23.840
What kind of logic is that?

13:23.840 --> 13:24.399
You...

13:24.559 --> 13:25.360
Fine.

13:26.120 --> 13:27.279
If something goes wrong,

13:28.000 --> 13:29.559
can your clan bear the responsibility?

13:31.399 --> 13:32.840
What could go wrong?

13:33.000 --> 13:34.600
And how is it any of our clan's concern?

13:34.610 --> 13:36.500
You are the ones
insisting on making trouble.

13:37.240 --> 13:39.240
Anyway, I will make this clear today.

13:39.600 --> 13:41.039
Regardless of who Hao marries,

13:41.759 --> 13:43.399
I dare you to interfere.

13:52.500 --> 13:55.330
♪Everyone says I'm a big silly fool♪

13:55.950 --> 13:59.350
♪When things happen,
I only know how to count on my fingers♪

14:00.120 --> 14:03.070
♪They shake their heads
and say I'm pitiful♪

14:03.410 --> 14:06.110
♪Sigh and walk away♪

14:07.710 --> 14:11.180
♪Little do they know,
I am sharp and bright♪

14:11.180 --> 14:13.410
♪With a heart like a mirror,
I understand the world's♪

14:13.410 --> 14:15.520
♪Colors and darkness♪

14:15.520 --> 14:17.540
♪But I keep my edge hidden♪

14:17.540 --> 14:21.900
♪The day I become famous
is just around the corner♪

14:23.340 --> 14:27.070
♪In the hotpot restaurant,
skewers boil in the broth♪

14:27.340 --> 14:30.940
♪People come and go,
with few worries or troubles♪

14:31.100 --> 14:33.180
♪The clacking of the abacus rings out♪

14:33.180 --> 14:37.970
♪See me differently.
Who dares to challenge me?♪

14:38.190 --> 14:39.810
♪The world mistakes me♪

14:39.810 --> 14:42.150
♪For an ignorant and stubborn fool♪

14:42.220 --> 14:43.410
♪As the storm approaches♪

14:43.410 --> 14:45.810
♪I just shrug and watch with a smile♪

14:46.020 --> 14:47.740
♪This foolish image is convenient♪

14:47.740 --> 14:49.720
♪I use it as a protective shield♪

14:49.890 --> 14:51.640
♪Navigating with ease, I attract♪

14:51.640 --> 14:53.740
♪A lucky star to accompany me♪

14:53.740 --> 14:55.210
♪In a peaceful golden age♪

14:55.210 --> 14:57.440
♪I hold my lady's hand
to watch the world♪

14:57.660 --> 14:58.860
♪Pouring youth and fireworks♪

14:58.860 --> 15:01.380
♪Into a precious glazed cup♪

15:01.510 --> 15:03.220
♪Having experienced life's changes♪

15:03.220 --> 15:04.500
♪And tasted its highs and lows♪

15:04.650 --> 15:06.070
♪My wish has finally come true♪

15:06.070 --> 15:07.110
♪To stay by your side♪

15:07.110 --> 15:09.030
♪In this fleeting world♪

15:09.200 --> 15:12.450
♪We are free and happy♪

15:16.450 --> 15:18.230
♪From a nobody♪

15:18.230 --> 15:20.130
♪To someone now famous♪

15:20.240 --> 15:21.670
♪Ordinary people laugh at me♪

15:21.670 --> 15:24.180
♪But I laugh at how
they cannot see through it all♪

15:24.280 --> 15:25.860
♪Let others plot and scheme♪

15:25.860 --> 15:27.930
♪I will keep my heart unchanged♪

15:28.140 --> 15:29.820
♪In this vast world♪

15:29.820 --> 15:31.820
♪I find my own leisurely freedom♪

15:31.970 --> 15:34.180
♪The world is bustling,
and things constantly change♪

15:34.180 --> 15:35.770
♪Everything ends eventually♪

15:35.860 --> 15:37.360
♪All that remains before my eyes♪

15:37.360 --> 15:39.760
♪Is this street wandering,
still tinged with pity♪

15:39.760 --> 15:41.470
♪No matter how time flies♪

15:41.470 --> 15:42.630
♪Even if the falling snow♪

15:42.630 --> 15:44.260
♪Dyes the hair at our temples white♪

15:44.260 --> 15:45.300
♪All I want now♪

15:45.300 --> 15:47.400
♪Is to pray for
my lady's peace and safety♪

15:47.400 --> 15:50.660
♪Year after year♪
